.claude/skills/

# Reference photos are committed only for landmarks flagged `test_ready`,
# which are force-added below the ignore. Photos for everything else stay on
# your disk until someone flags that landmark — binaries are permanent once
# they are in git history, so we only pay for the ones we actually use.
#
#   to include a landmark's photos:  set "test_ready": true in landmarks.json,
#   run `npm run photos`, then `git add -f public/landmarks/<id>`
public/landmarks/*/*.jpg
public/landmarks/*/*.jpeg
public/landmarks/*/*.png
public/landmarks/*/*.webp
public/landmarks/*/*.avif
